  "question": {
    "text": "A small bob of mass 100 mg and charge $+10 \\mu \\mathrm{C}$ is connected to an insulating string of length 1 m. It is brought near to an infinitely long nonconducting sheet of charge density ' $\\sigma$ ' as shown in figure. If string subtends an angle of $45^{\\circ}$ with the sheet at equilibrium the charge density of sheet will be :<br/>(Given, $\\varepsilon_0=8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\frac{\\mathrm{~F}}{\\mathrm{~m}}$ and acceleration due to gravity, $g=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$)<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1EpPEURCP5Ix_xGUrB4RhVE_-vuwF7UvIdiqFExwM4Y.original.fullsize.png\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "dfbhP",
      "text": "$0.885 \\mathrm{nC} / \\mathrm{m}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "FXWx7",
      "text": "$17.7 \\mathrm{nC} / \\mathrm{m}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Qhmk5",
      "text": "$885 \\mathrm{nC} / \\mathrm{m}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Mz6FN",
      "text": "$1.77 \\mathrm{nC} / \\mathrm{m}^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/MWpxmQR0NR_3rYnuG7lF-wa00y43X_LbqxroNyqKwZM.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{qE}=\\mathrm{mg} \\\\ & \\mathrm{q}\\left[\\frac{\\sigma}{2 \\varepsilon_0}\\right]=\\mathrm{mg} \\\\ & \\sigma=\\frac{2 \\varepsilon_0 \\mathrm{mg}}{\\mathrm{q}} \\\\ & \\sigma=\\frac{2 \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 100 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 10}{10 \\times 10^{-6}} \\\\ & \\sigma=17.7 \\times 10^{-10} \\mathrm{C} / \\mathrm{m}^2 \\\\ & \\sigma=1.77 \\mathrm{nC} / \\mathrm{m}^2\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
